07_settings_filters
===================

150 MeV proton pencil beam in a PMMA cylinder (R=10 cm, L=20 cm).
100 primaries, Moliere scattering, Vavilov straggling, nuclear reactions off.

Scoring: single mesh geometry (21x21x40 cm, 800 z-bins).

Filters:
  Primary  — generation 0 protons only
  Protons  — all protons

Settings (material overrides for dose-to-medium conversion):
  in_Water — Water stopping power
  in_Si    — Silicon stopping power

Scored quantities per output:
  Dose               — dose in transport medium (PMMA)
  Dose inWater       — dose-to-water (SPR correction applied)
  Dose inSi          — dose-to-silicon (SPR correction applied)
  Fluence            — all particles
  Fluence Primary    — primary protons only (filter applied)

Output in both TEXT and BDO formats.
